Subject: [PATCH] Build static Wasm libraries and register unique KDE factories

Use Qt executable targets and explicit plugin imports, retain static plugin
archives, and give every KDE factory a target-specific Qt plugin name.
Three private generic Plugin implementations also need distinct class names
when their archives are linked into one program. Native target types stay
unchanged. Do not build desktop version CLI or test fixtures in this profile.

